# pi writes its own state into whatever PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR points at. A run
# points it at a copy of this folder in the task workspace, so nothing here
# should ever change — but a stray `pi` invoked against this directory
# directly (say, `pi --list-models` while debugging) leaves these behind.
# They are runtime state, not harness template, and auth.json can hold
# credentials.
auth.json
models-store.json
trust.json
sessions/
npm/
